@startuml
[*] --> Waiting for Appliance Status
Waiting for Appliance Status --> Fetching Weather Data : Appliance turned on/off
Fetching Weather Data --> Sending Weather Forecast : Weather data fetched
Sending Weather Forecast --> Displaying Forecast : Forecast sent
Displaying Forecast --> Monitoring Weather Changes : Forecast displayed
Monitoring Weather Changes --> Notifying User : Weather change detected
Notifying User --> [*] : Notification sent
@enduml
